{
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "start": 3.5,
   "end": 8.599,
   "text": "I deliver food at night, and the other drivers warned me about one address."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 9.099,
   "end": 14.432,
   "text": "Fourteen Larkin Road. If the app ever sends you there after midnight... cancel it."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 15.032,
   "end": 19.917,
   "text": "And if you can't cancel... leave the bag on the step, and never look in the window."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 20.717,
   "end": 25.069,
   "text": "For weeks, it never came up. Just burgers, and empty streets."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 26.869,
   "end": 31.819,
   "text": "Then, at two-forty one morning, my phone chimed. Fourteen Larkin Road."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 32.519,
   "end": 36.679,
   "text": "I tapped cancel. Nothing happened. The button had gone gray."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 37.579,
   "end": 42.165,
   "text": "The house sat alone at the end of a dirt road. Every window dark."
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 42.965,
   "end": 46.123,
   "text": "I set the bag on the step... and I looked."
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 47.323,
   "end": 53.061,
   "text": "The living room was full of people. Standing perfectly still. All of them... facing the door."
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 54.061,
   "end": 58.371,
   "text": "I walked back to my car... and drove home with the radio off."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 59.171,
   "end": 62.477,
   "text": "At three a.m., my phone chimed again."
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 64.077,
   "end": 68.301,
   "text": "Not an order for me to deliver. An order on its way... to me."
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 69.201,
   "end": 72.785,
   "text": "Driver... Fourteen Larkin Road. Arriving now."
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "start": 73.985,
   "end": 79.297,
   "text": "Then my doorbell rang. And a note lit up my screen. Please don't look in the window."
  }
 ],
